---
import { getLangFromUrl } from '../i18n/ui';

const unne = 'https://www.unne.edu.ar/'
const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
---

<section class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 justify-center items-center">
    <div
        class="[&>p]:mb-5 [&>p]:leading-relaxed [&>p>strong]:text-yellow-400 [&>p>strong]:font-semibold [&>p>strong>a]:hover:text-sky-300 [&>p>strong>a]:transition-colors text-pretty order-2 md:order-1">
        {lang === 'en' ? (
        <>
        <p>
            I'm Juan Cruz Martínez, a <strong>Software Engineer with 6+ years of experience</strong> focused on
            <strong>building and maintaining web applications</strong>, working across both <strong>frontend and backend</strong>
            in production environments and distributed teams.
        </p>

        <p>
            I hold a
            <strong><a class="text-yellow-400 text-decoration-line: none; hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors duration-300" href={unne} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">degree in Information Systems from UNNE</a></strong>,
            I've built <strong>multiple projects from scratch</strong>, and I specialize in
            <strong>ASP.NET Core, Angular and Node.js</strong>, with PostgreSQL/MySQL databases and cloud deployments (GCP). Currently focused on <strong><em class="italic">improving processes and business rules</em> to increase revenue and reduce costs.</strong> <strong><em class="italic">Working remotely</em></strong> with global and local teams.
        </p>
        </>
        ) : (
        <>
        <p>
            Me llamo Juan Cruz Martínez. <strong>Software Engineer con +6 años de experiencia</strong> especializado en 
            <strong>desarrollo y mantenimiento de aplicaciones web</strong>, trabajando tanto en <strong>frontend como backend</strong> 
            en entornos productivos y equipos distribuidos.
        </p>

        <p>
            Graduado como 
            <strong><a class="text-yellow-400 text-decoration-line: none; hover:text-sky-300 transition-colors duration-300" href=`${unne}` target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lic. en Sistemas por la UNNE</a></strong>, 
            he desarrollado <strong>múltiples proyectos desde cero</strong> y me especializo en tecnologías como
            <strong>ASP.NET Core, Angular y Node.js</strong>, con bases de datos PostgreSQL/MySQL y despliegues en la nube (GCP). Actualmente enfocado en <strong><em class="italic">mejorar procesos y reglas de negocio</em> para aumentar ganancias y reducir costos.</strong> <strong><em class="italic">Trabajo remoto</em></strong> para equipos globales y locales.
        </p>
        </>
        )}
    </div>

    <img
        src="/photo.webp"
        alt={lang === 'en' ? 'Profile photo of Juan Cruz Martínez - Software Engineer' : 'Foto de perfil de Juan Cruz Martínez - Software Engineer'}
        class="rounded-full size-64 order-1 md:order-2 shadow-2xl shadow-yellow-400/20 ring-2 ring-yellow-400/30 hover:shadow-yellow-400/40 transition-all duration-300"
        width="256"
        height="256"
        loading="lazy"
    />
</section>


<style>
    @keyframes reveal {
		from {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateY(30px);
		}
		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}
	}

	section {
		animation: reveal both;
		animation-timeline: view();
		animation-range: entry 20% cover 40%;
	}
</style>